              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na athembaa na kũtoeeasya ũvani kũla kũndũ kũtũlu, na iĩmanĩ, na ĩtina wa kĩla mũtĩ mwĩũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Yeova Ngai wake amũnengane kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ wa Silia; na mamũkũna, na matwaa ma andũ make aingĩ mũno me atave, na mamavikya Ndamasiku. Nake mwene anenganwe kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, ũla wamũkũnie na ũai mũnene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 16.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 7.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ Veka mwana wa Lemalia nĩwoaie ku Yuta andũ ngili ĩana na mĩongo ĩlĩ mũthenya ũmwe, onthe andũ ngũmbaũ; nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmatiĩte Yeova, Ngai wa aaĩthe moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 15.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nzikili, mũndũ ngũmbaũ wa Evalaimu, ooaa Maaseia mwana wa mũsumbĩ, na Asilikamu mũnene wa nyũmba, na Elikana ũla waĩ wa kelĩ ũsumbĩnĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Isilaeli matwaa ana‐a‐ĩthe moo mamatavĩte ngili maana elĩ, aka, na ana, na eĩtu, o oa matava mũtavo mwingĩ kuma kwoo, na matwaa mũtavo Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ mwathani wa Yeova aĩ kw’o, ũla wetawa syĩtwa yake Oteti: na aumaala akomane na nguthu ĩla yokĩte Samalia, na amĩtavya, Sisya, nĩkwĩthĩwa Yeova, Ngai wa aaĩthe menyu, nĩwathilĩkĩle Yuta, nũmanenganĩte kw’okonĩ kwenyu, na nĩmũmoaĩte na ũthatu mwai ũvikĩte ĩtunĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.47.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 47.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ũvu 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu nĩmũsũanĩĩte kwĩkalya ana ma Yuta na Yelusaleme methĩwe ngombo kwenyu aũme na aka: ĩndĩ inyw’ĩ kũti mavĩtyo o na kwenyu ĩũlũ wa Ngai wenyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu yu mbĩthukĩĩsyai na mũitũnga ala atave, ala mũtavĩte ma ana‐a‐ĩthe menyu; nũndũ ũthilĩku mwai wa Yeova wĩ ĩũlũ wenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ amwe ma atongoi ma ana ma Evalaimu, nao nĩ Asalia mwana wa Yoanani, na Mbelekia mwana wa Mesilemothi, na Yeisikia mwana wa Salumu, na Amasa mwana wa Aatilai, maũngamie mamasiĩĩe ala mookie kuma kaũnĩ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mamea, Mũtilikya ala atave vaa: nũndũ nĩmũsũanĩĩte ũndũ ũla wĩtũetee ĩvĩtyo kũla kwĩ Yeova, na kwongeleela naĩ sitũ o na ĩvĩtyo yitũ; nũndũ ĩvĩtyo yitũ nĩ ĩnene, na ve kũthilĩkĩlwa kwai ĩũlũ wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu andũ ala meekĩe mĩio ya kaũ matia ala atave o na mũtavo kũla kwĩ anene me mbee ũsumbĩnĩ na ũmbano w’onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na andũ ala mawetetwe masyĩtwa mookĩla, na moosa ala matavĩtwe, na kumya vu mũtavonĩ mamavw’ĩka onthe katĩ woo ala maĩ athei, na mamekĩa ngũa, na mamekĩa iatũ, na memanenga kya ũya na kya ũnyw’a, na mametĩkĩsya mauta, na makuĩthya onthe moo ala mataĩ na vinya mang’oinĩ, na mamaete Yeliko, ndũa ya mĩtende, kwa ana‐a‐ĩthe moo: na ĩndĩ masyoka Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
