          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aasu akoma na aaĩthe make, na mamũthika ndũanĩ, o Yelusaleme; nũndũ matyaamũete ngunganĩ vala vathikawa asumbĩ ma Isilaeli: na Esekia mwana wake asumbĩka vandũ vake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.27"
            ]
